      "part": "problem",
      "original_record": "before",
      "value": "Suppose that $f(x)$ is defined as\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-1), & x>1 \\\\ x-1, & x\\le 1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nOn which of the following intervals can the extreme value theorem be applied to the function?\n\nI. $[0,2]$\n\nII. $[-1,0]$\n\nIII. $[-1,2]$",
